Ticket #4471 was marked known. The desk merged the reports as one parser bug: the shared parser reads dates month-first, and these tenants write the day first.

The cause table keeps those parser rows on #4471. The other rows are the hint bug. booking-v3 prints MM/DD/YYYY under the date field. On a day-first tenant the person types the month first, and the form reads the day first. Those rows were merged into #4471 and have no ticket of their own.

<Callout kind="warn">
The parser fix does not cover the hint rows. They need a ticket of their own.
</Callout>

